## Phase 10.23 - Condition Workflow Nodes
- Enabled CONDITION nodes in the SkyServer workflow builder and manager surfaces.
- Added a reusable condition parameter editor for input/previous/named-node-output paths, typed comparisons, and false-action behavior.
- Added condition evaluation to the inline and Temporal-backed workflow executors.
