## Phase 10.20 - Child SkyServer Workflow Nodes
- Added WORKFLOW nodes as supported Workflow Builder nodes for composing active SkyServer workflows inside parent workflows.
- Create/Manage Workflows can now add child workflow nodes from active SkyServer workflow targets while blocking direct self-recursion.
- Added recursive cycle detection so saving a workflow graph cannot create child workflow loops through existing active graphs.
- Temporal-backed workflow execution now runs child SkyServer workflows as Temporal child executions and waits for completion before completing the parent node.
- Workflow History node timelines now surface child workflow run and child Temporal workflow identifiers.
